    <dc:title>
      <rdf:Alt>
        <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Insight Sales are not really spiky. They climbed steadily from $87K in 2019 to $2.48M in 2025, up 45% in 2024 and 48% in 2025. Q4 is the strongest stretch, running 16 to 18% above the yearly average from October to December. Growth comes mostly from new</rdf:li>
