<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 66 0 R/T(The Analysis :  The AVG\(retail_price\) OVER \(PARTITION BY category\) window function adds each category\220s average price to every product row. The query then calculates how far each product is from that average, uses IF to flag products above it, sorts by the difference and returns the top 20.)/E(The Analysis :  The AVG\(retail_price\) OVER \(PARTITION BY category\) window function adds each category\220s average price to every product row. The query then calculates how far each product is from that average, uses IF to flag products above it, sorts by the difference and returns the top 20.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[31]>>
endobj

