218 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 67 0 R/T(Insight  First orders bring nearly 64% of sales \(80,131 orders, $6.9M\) and repeat orders 36% \($3.9M\). Average order value is almost identical \($86.26 vs $86.93\), so repeat customers do not spend more per order. They just come back, about 0.56 repeat orders per customer. Winning new customers matters most, and bundles or loyalty offers could lift repeat baskets.)/E(Insight  First orders bring nearly 64% of sales \(80,131 orders, $6.9M\) and repeat orders 36% \($3.9M\). Average order value is almost identical \($86.26 vs $86.93\), so repeat customers do not spend more per order. They just come back, about 0.56 repeat orders per customer. Winning new customers matters most, and bundles or loyalty offers could lift repeat baskets.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[27]>>
