251 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 68 0 R/T(Insight  Returns cost about $1.06M, or 9.98% of sales. The rate is similar in almost every category \(9 to 10%\), so this is a company-wide issue, not one bad category. The money sits in the big sellers: Jeans and Outerwear make up 23% of returned value. Suits has the highest rate at 11.5%, but from a small base. Suggestion : We would start with fit and quality checks on Jeans and Outerwear and find which need to launch new model ?)/E(Insight  Returns cost about $1.06M, or 9.98% of sales. The rate is similar in almost every category \(9 to 10%\), so this is a company-wide issue, not one bad category. The money sits in the big sellers: Jeans and Outerwear make up 23% of returned value. Suits has the highest rate at 11.5%, but from a small base. Suggestion : We would start with fit and quality checks on Jeans and Outerwear and find which need to launch new model ?)/Pg 15 0 R/K[32]>>
endobj

