295 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 69 0 R/T(Insight  Only 10% of customers are active \(ordered in the last 30 days\) and 10% are passive \(31 to 90 days\). The other 80% have not ordered in over 90 days, and this holds everywhere: churn is 79 to 81% in all 12 markets with 100+ customers. The 8,042 passive customers are the easiest to win back, mostly in China, the US and Brazil. A retention program should then cover all markets.)/E(Insight  Only 10% of customers are active \(ordered in the last 30 days\) and 10% are passive \(31 to 90 days\). The other 80% have not ordered in over 90 days, and this holds everywhere: churn is 79 to 81% in all 12 markets with 100+ customers. The 8,042 passive customers are the easiest to win back, mostly in China, the US and Brazil. A retention program should then cover all markets.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[43]>>
